Z||000000||zeusrekning||04-23-2000||08:35 PM||||I changed my timing gears and the clutch in my 87 fiero.Actually my girfriends dad did but there are some problems we could not get the clutch to disengage so i could change gears so we used a longer push rod in the slave cylinder. We had to by pass the clutch switch B/C the car would not start. It pops out of first and third gear when changing third is worse. My timing cover leakes about 1.5 - 2 quarts of oil a day. And my oil pressure gage stays abou 40 and used to stay abou 60. Please help. Especially about clutch.PS can the timing be adjusted on the 4cylinders anywhere other than the timing gears.I did fix the missing cradel mount.||||reg||9
